  Description: "COMPANION / UNCOMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nAn immortal friendly marble.
    Uses its own randomly assigned weapon.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTier 1/2/3 traits
    \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING
    REALM\nA valley resident whose round body was mistaken for cargo. They memorised
    voices until another passenger answered them. They want a station sign that begins:
    ask the traveller their name.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic personal
    passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated
    percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed
    support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nSource: gift / nursery / special
    reward; not ordinary shop stock.\r\nBonds: frost, mask. Immortal. Weapon rolls
    on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent
    forbids it."
